msgid "For multi-variant roles you MAY restrict any of the `make compose-deploy` invocations above (and the dev CLI subcommands) to one or more matrix rounds by setting `variant=<csv>` — a single index pins one round, a comma-separated list iterates that subset (the runner-split bundle CI produces), and empty/unset is the full matrix:"
