msgid "MCP is a client-server protocol for connecting AI hosts to external tools, resources, and prompts. Several roles in this repository deploy applications whose upstream projects document MCP support. The current tree contains 18 role-local `mcp:` blocks, but metadata presence does not prove endpoint compatibility, least-privilege credentials, application-scoped user authorization, client provisioning, or an end-to-end tool call."
